      "message": "This is great analysis. So it\u0027s possible that an unbonded device can initiate connection, in which case the `available_profiles` can be empty, I was unaware of this.\n\nI think the current policy is not well-prepared for cases where `available_profiles` can be empty while connection occurs, and this fixes a subset of such issues.\n\nAs a side discussion, maybe not in this CL, could this fix be extended by checking `available_profiles.is_empty` instead of `is_bonded` as a means of resetting the states (and consider re-connection strategies if recoverable)?",
